<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
<meta charset="UTF-8">
<meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
<meta name="description" content="VBS Group — Verma Business Solutions. Building businesses. Creating value.">
<title>VBS Group | Verma Business Solutions</title>
<style>
:root{
 --navy:#101f35;--navy2:#172d49;--ink:#182333;--muted:#697586;--gold:#b9955b;
 --cream:#f6f4ef;--paper:#fffefa;--line:#e5e1d8;--white:#fff;--green:#527566;
 --serif:Georgia,'Times New Roman',serif;--sans:Inter,Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif;
}
*{box-sizing:border-box}html{scroll-behavior:smooth}body{margin:0;background:var(--paper);color:var(--ink);font-family:var(--sans);line-height:1.6}
a{color:inherit;text-decoration:none}.wrap{width:min(1160px,calc(100% - 48px));margin:auto}
.topbar{background:var(--navy);color:#d9dfE7;font-size:11px;letter-spacing:.12em;text-transform:uppercase}
.topbar .wrap{display:flex;justify-content:space-between;padding:10px 0}
header{position:sticky;top:0;z-index:20;background:rgba(255,254,250,.96);backdrop-filter:blur(14px);border-bottom:1px solid var(--line)}
.nav{height:82px;display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:space-between;gap:24px}
.brand{display:flex;align-items:center;gap:12px}.monogram{width:43px;height:43px;border:1px solid var(--gold);display:grid;place-items:center;color:var(--navy);font-family:var(--serif);font-size:20px;letter-spacing:-2px}
.brand strong{display:block;font-family:var(--serif);font-size:19px;letter-spacing:.12em;color:var(--navy);line-height:1.1}.brand small{display:block;font-size:9px;letter-spacing:.17em;color:var(--muted);margin-top:5px}
nav{display:flex;align-items:center;gap:27px;font-size:12px;color:#3d4857}nav a{transition:.2s}nav a:hover{color:var(--gold)}
.nav-cta{border:1px solid var(--navy);padding:11px 17px;font-size:11px;letter-spacing:.08em;text-transform:uppercase}
.menu{display:none;background:none;border:0;font-size:25px;color:var(--navy)}
.hero{background:var(--navy);color:white;position:relative;overflow:hidden}
.hero:before{content:"";position:absolute;width:660px;height:660px;border:1px solid rgba(185,149,91,.22);border-radius:50%;right:-100px;top:-245px}
.hero:after{content:"";position:absolute;width:470px;height:470px;border:1px solid rgba(185,149,91,.15);border-radius:50%;right:-5px;top:-150px}
.hero-grid{position:relative;z-index:1;display:grid;grid-template-columns:1.2fr .8fr;gap:70px;align-items:center;padding:105px 0 110px}
.eyebrow{font-size:10px;letter-spacing:.23em;text-transform:uppercase;color:var(--gold);font-weight:700}
h1{font-family:var(--serif);font-size:clamp(46px,6vw,76px);font-weight:400;line-height:1.04;letter-spacing:-.035em;margin:24px 0}
h1 em{color:#d7bd91;font-style:italic}
.hero p{max-width:560px;color:#c7d0dc;font-size:16px;line-height:1.9}
.actions{display:flex;gap:13px;flex-wrap:wrap;margin-top:34px}
.btn{display:inline-flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;padding:14px 20px;font-size:11px;letter-spacing:.1em;text-transform:uppercase;font-weight:700;transition:.2s}
.btn-gold{background:var(--gold);color:#111e30}.btn-gold:hover{background:#d0b27f;transform:translateY(-2px)}
.btn-outline{border:1px solid rgba(255,255,255,.38);color:white}.btn-outline:hover{border-color:var(--gold);color:#e1c99f}
.hero-card{border:1px solid rgba(185,149,91,.48);padding:34px;min-height:310px;display:flex;flex-direction:column;justify-content:space-between;background:linear-gradient(145deg,rgba(255,255,255,.06),rgba(255,255,255,.015))}
.hero-card .big{font-family:var(--serif);font-size:58px;color:#d8c39e;line-height:1}.hero-card p{font-family:var(--serif);font-size:21px;color:#f2eee6;line-height:1.5;margin:20px 0}
.hero-card small{color:#aeb9c8;letter-spacing:.16em;text-transform:uppercase;font-size:9px}
.strip{background:var(--cream);border-bottom:1px solid var(--line)}.strip-grid{display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(3,1fr)}
.strip-item{padding:24px 28px;border-right:1px solid var(--line)}.strip-item:first-child{padding-left:0}.strip-item:last-child{border:0}
.strip-item b{display:block;font-family:var(--serif);font-size:18px;font-weight:400;color:var(--navy)}.strip-item span{font-size:10px;letter-spacing:.12em;text-transform:uppercase;color:var(--muted)}
section{padding:100px 0}.section-head{max-width:690px;margin-bottom:45px}.section-head h2{font-family:var(--serif);font-weight:400;color:var(--navy);font-size:clamp(34px,4vw,48px);line-height:1.15;margin:14px 0}
.section-head p{color:var(--muted);font-size:15px;line-height:1.9}
.about-grid{display:grid;grid-template-columns:.8fr 1.2fr;gap:90px;align-items:start}
.about-note{border-top:2px solid var(--gold);padding-top:22px;color:var(--navy);font-family:var(--serif);font-size:25px;line-height:1.45}
.about-copy p{color:var(--muted);font-size:15px;line-height:2;margin:0 0 18px}
.values{display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(3,1fr);gap:1px;background:var(--line);border:1px solid var(--line);margin-top:48px}
.value{background:var(--paper);padding:25px}.value b{font-family:var(--serif);font-size:19px;font-weight:400;color:var(--navy)}.value p{font-size:12px;color:var(--muted);margin-bottom:0}
.business{background:var(--cream)}
.business-grid{display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(2,1fr);gap:18px}
.business-card{background:var(--paper);border:1px solid var(--line);padding:30px;min-height:230px;position:relative;transition:.25s}
.business-card:hover{transform:translateY(-4px);box-shadow:0 18px 40px rgba(16,31,53,.08);border-color:#c9b48f}
.num{font-family:var(--serif);font-size:14px;color:var(--gold)}
.business-card h3{font-family:var(--serif);font-weight:400;font-size:25px;color:var(--navy);margin:23px 0 9px}
.business-card p{color:var(--muted);font-size:13px;max-width:440px;line-height:1.8}
.status{display:inline-block;margin-top:12px;font-size:9px;letter-spacing:.13em;text-transform:uppercase;color:var(--green);border:1px solid #cbd8d0;padding:5px 8px}
.philosophy{background:var(--navy);color:white}
.philosophy .section-head h2{color:white}.philosophy .section-head p{color:#b8c3d0}
.phil-grid{display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(3,1fr);gap:30px}
.phil{border-top:1px solid rgba(185,149,91,.6);padding-top:20px}.phil span{font-family:var(--serif);font-size:35px;color:var(--gold)}.phil h3{font-family:var(--serif);font-weight:400;font-size:21px;margin:12px 0}.phil p{font-size:13px;color:#b8c3d0;line-height:1.9}
.insights-grid{display:grid;grid-template-columns:1.1fr .9fr;gap:24px}
.feature{background:var(--navy2);color:white;padding:38px;min-height:280px;display:flex;flex-direction:column;justify-content:space-between}
.feature small,.insight small{font-size:9px;letter-spacing:.16em;text-transform:uppercase;color:var(--gold)}
.feature h3{font-family:var(--serif);font-weight:400;font-size:30px;line-height:1.25;max-width:500px}
.feature p{font-size:13px;color:#c3ccd8}
.insight-list{border-top:1px solid var(--line)}.insight{padding:22px 0;border-bottom:1px solid var(--line)}.insight h3{font-family:var(--serif);font-weight:400;font-size:19px;color:var(--navy);margin:8px 0}.insight p{font-size:12px;color:var(--muted);margin:0}
.contact{background:var(--cream)}
.contact-grid{display:grid;grid-template-columns:1fr 1fr;gap:80px}
.contact-copy h2{font-family:var(--serif);font-weight:400;font-size:45px;line-height:1.1;color:var(--navy);margin:15px 0}
.contact-copy p{color:var(--muted);font-size:14px;line-height:1.9}
.contact-panel{background:var(--paper);border:1px solid var(--line);padding:30px}
label{display:block;font-size:10px;text-transform:uppercase;letter-spacing:.12em;color:#596575;margin:0 0 7px}
input,textarea{width:100%;padding:13px 12px;border:1px solid #ddd8ce;background:#fffefa;font:14px var(--sans);margin-bottom:17px;color:var(--ink)}
textarea{min-height:105px;resize:vertical}input:focus,textarea:focus{outline:1px solid var(--gold);border-color:var(--gold)}
.contact-panel button{border:0;cursor:pointer;width:100%}.form-note{font-size:11px;color:var(--muted);margin:12px 0 0}
footer{background:#0b1728;color:#c1cad5;padding:48px 0 22px}
.footer-top{display:flex;justify-content:space-between;gap:40px;align-items:flex-start;padding-bottom:35px;border-bottom:1px solid rgba(255,255,255,.13)}
footer .brand strong{color:white}footer .brand small{color:#9eabba}footer p{font-size:12px;color:#9eabba;max-width:390px}
.footer-links{display:flex;gap:24px;flex-wrap:wrap;font-size:11px}.footer-links a:hover{color:#d7bd91}
.legal{font-size:10px;color:#8290a1;line-height:1.8;padding-top:22px}.copyright{display:flex;justify-content:space-between;gap:20px;font-size:10px;color:#8290a1;padding-top:20px}
@media(max-width:850px){nav{display:none;position:absolute;top:82px;left:0;right:0;background:var(--paper);padding:20px 24px;border-bottom:1px solid var(--line);flex-direction:column;align-items:flex-start;gap:18px}nav.open{display:flex}.menu{display:block}.nav-cta{display:none}.hero-grid{grid-template-columns:1fr;gap:35px;padding:75px 0}.hero-card{max-width:520px}.about-grid,.contact-grid{grid-template-columns:1fr;gap:35px}.about-grid{gap:25px}.phil-grid{grid-template-columns:1fr;gap:25px}}
@media(max-width:600px){.wrap{width:min(100% - 34px,1160px)}.topbar .wrap{font-size:9px}.topbar .wrap span:last-child{display:none}.nav{height:72px}.brand strong{font-size:17px}nav{top:72px}.hero-grid{padding:65px 0}.hero-card{min-height:250px;padding:25px}.hero-card .big{font-size:48px}section{padding:70px 0}.strip-grid{grid-template-columns:1fr}.strip-item{border-right:0;border-bottom:1px solid var(--line);padding:17px 0}.strip-item:last-child{border-bottom:0}.values,.business-grid,.insights-grid{grid-template-columns:1fr}.value{padding:20px}.business-card{min-height:0;padding:25px}.feature{padding:27px;min-height:260px}.contact-copy h2{font-size:38px}.contact-panel{padding:22px}.footer-top,.copyright{flex-direction:column}.footer-links{gap:15px}.copyright{gap:8px}}
</style>
</head>
<body>
<div class="topbar"><div class="wrap"><span>Independent thinking · Long-term perspective</span><span>India · Building with purpose</span></div></div>
<header><div class="wrap nav">
 <a class="brand" href="#home" aria-label="VBS Group home"><span class="monogram">VBS</span><span><strong>VBS GROUP</strong><small>VERMA BUSINESS SOLUTIONS</small></span></a>
 <nav id="nav"><a href="#about">ABOUT</a><a href="#businesses">OUR BUSINESSES</a><a href="#philosophy">PHILOSOPHY</a><a href="#insights">INSIGHTS</a><a href="#contact">CONTACT</a></nav>
 <a class="nav-cta" href="#contact">Start a conversation ↗</a><button class="menu" id="menu" aria-label="Open navigation">☰</button>
</div></header>
<main>
<section class="hero" id="home"><div class="wrap hero-grid">
 <div><div class="eyebrow">Verma Business Solutions · India</div>
 <h1>Building businesses.<br><em>Creating value.</em></h1>
 <p>VBS Group is an entrepreneurial platform focused on developing thoughtful businesses, delivering useful services and pursuing sustainable, long-term value.</p>
 <div class="actions"><a class="btn btn-gold" href="#businesses">Explore our businesses</a><a class="btn btn-outline" href="#about">Discover VBS</a></div>
 </div>
 <div class="hero-card"><div class="big">VBS</div><div><p>“Strong businesses are built with clarity, integrity and patience.”</p><small>Our guiding principle</small></div></div>
</div></section>
<div class="strip"><div class="wrap strip-grid">
 <div class="strip-item"><b>Entrepreneurial thinking</b><span>Build with purpose</span></div>
 <div class="strip-item"><b>Responsible growth</b><span>Value over noise</span></div>
 <div class="strip-item"><b>Long-term perspective</b><span>Think beyond the quarter</span></div>
</div></div>
<section id="about"><div class="wrap">
 <div class="section-head"><div class="eyebrow">Who we are</div><h2>A business group built around a long-term view.</h2><p>Our ambition is to create a platform where ideas can become enduring businesses and where trust is earned through consistent action.</p></div>
 <div class="about-grid"><div class="about-note">“Our focus is not simply to start businesses, but to build organisations that create lasting value.”</div>
 <div class="about-copy"><p>VBS Group — Verma Business Solutions — is an India-based entrepreneurial initiative founded by Vikas Verma. The group is being developed with a focus on business building, financial awareness, professional services and responsible capital allocation.</p><p>We believe credibility comes from transparency, disciplined execution and delivering on commitments. Our businesses and initiatives will grow step by step, with a clear distinction between what is operational today and what is planned for tomorrow.</p></div></div>
 <div class="values"><div class="value"><b>Integrity</b><p>Be clear, honest and accountable in every interaction.</p></div><div class="value"><b>Discipline</b><p>Make considered decisions and execute with consistency.</p></div><div class="value"><b>Long-term value</b><p>Prioritise durable outcomes over short-lived attention.</p></div></div>
</div></section>
<section class="business" id="businesses"><div class="wrap">
 <div class="section-head"><div class="eyebrow">Our business ecosystem</div><h2>Different capabilities.<br>One long-term philosophy.</h2><p>VBS is designed as a multi-business platform. The following areas represent the group's intended business directions; each will be presented as operational only when formally established and active.</p></div>
 <div class="business-grid">
  <article class="business-card"><span class="num">01 / FINANCIAL SERVICES</span><h3>VBS Financial Services</h3><p>Customer-focused financial distribution and related services, delivered within applicable regulatory and licensing requirements.</p><span class="status">Business direction</span></article>
  <article class="business-card"><span class="num">02 / ENTREPRENEURSHIP</span><h3>VBS Ventures</h3><p>Exploring business ideas, partnerships and opportunities to develop practical, sustainable enterprises.</p><span class="status">Business direction</span></article>
  <article class="business-card"><span class="num">03 / CAPITAL & OWNERSHIP</span><h3>VBS Investments</h3><p>A long-term orientation towards understanding businesses, evaluating opportunities and responsible capital allocation.</p><span class="status">Future initiative</span></article>
  <article class="business-card"><span class="num">04 / EDUCATION</span><h3>Finance Pathshala</h3><p>Accessible financial education designed to help people understand money, markets and financial decision-making.</p><span class="status">Education initiative</span></article>
 </div>
</div></section>
<section class="philosophy" id="philosophy"><div class="wrap">
 <div class="section-head"><div class="eyebrow">Our philosophy</div><h2>Think clearly. Act responsibly.<br>Build for the long term.</h2><p>We draw inspiration from enduring business principles: owner-mindedness, research, sound judgement and a commitment to stakeholders.</p></div>
 <div class="phil-grid"><div class="phil"><span>01</span><h3>Understand before acting</h3><p>Good decisions begin with asking better questions, understanding fundamentals and being honest about uncertainty.</p></div><div class="phil"><span>02</span><h3>Earn trust over time</h3><p>Reputation is built through transparent communication, reliable service and taking responsibility for outcomes.</p></div><div class="phil"><span>03</span><h3>Compound capabilities</h3><p>Develop people, processes and businesses patiently so that progress can become sustainable over time.</p></div></div>
</div></section>
<section id="insights"><div class="wrap">
 <div class="section-head"><div class="eyebrow">Ideas & perspectives</div><h2>Curiosity is a business advantage.</h2><p>Our planned insights platform will share practical perspectives on business, financial literacy, markets and entrepreneurship.</p></div>
 <div class="insights-grid"><div class="feature"><small>VBS JOURNAL · COMING SOON</small><h3>Better questions lead to better business decisions.</h3><p>Thoughtful learning, practical frameworks and long-term perspectives.</p></div><div class="insight-list">
  <article class="insight"><small>BUSINESS</small><h3>What makes a business durable?</h3><p>A framework for thinking beyond short-term performance.</p></article>
  <article class="insight"><small>FINANCIAL LITERACY</small><h3>Understanding money before investing.</h3><p>Building sound financial foundations through education.</p></article>
  <article class="insight"><small>ENTREPRENEURSHIP</small><h3>From idea to disciplined execution.</h3><p>Why focus, customer value and cash flow matter.</p></article>
 </div></div>
</div></section>
<section class="contact" id="contact"><div class="wrap contact-grid">
 <div class="contact-copy"><div class="eyebrow">Contact VBS Group</div><h2>Let's start a meaningful conversation.</h2><p>For business enquiries, collaborations or general information, send us a message. We will add verified contact details here before the website goes live.</p><p><strong>VBS Group</strong><br>Verma Business Solutions<br>India</p></div>
 <form class="contact-panel" id="contactForm"><label for="name">Your name</label><input id="name" name="name" placeholder="Full name" required>
 <label for="email">Email address</label><input id="email" name="email" type="email" placeholder="name@example.com" required>
 <label for="subject">Enquiry type</label><input id="subject" name="subject" placeholder="Business enquiry, collaboration, general">
 <label for="message">Message</label><textarea id="message" name="message" placeholder="How can we help?" required></textarea>
 <button class="btn btn-gold" type="submit">Prepare enquiry ↗</button><p class="form-note" id="formNote">This demo form prepares an email draft; it does not transmit or store your information.</p></form>
</div></section>
</main>
<footer><div class="wrap">
 <div class="footer-top"><div><a class="brand" href="#home"><span class="monogram" style="color:white">VBS</span><span><strong>VBS GROUP</strong><small>VERMA BUSINESS SOLUTIONS</small></span></a><p>Building businesses. Creating value. An entrepreneurial platform with a long-term perspective.</p></div>
 <div class="footer-links"><a href="#about">About</a><a href="#businesses">Businesses</a><a href="#philosophy">Philosophy</a><a href="#insights">Insights</a><a href="#contact">Contact</a></div></div>
